            "review_title": "Review at Pho Co Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Richard K\nMemphis, Tennessee1913 contributions\n0\nDelicious\nJan 2019 • Friends\nThis is Vietnamese street food at it’s best. I recommend everything because I think we tried everything. They are not really fast, because they prepare your food when you order. So relax and enjoy the atmosphere. It’s a popular place for teenagers in the evening. Remember, it’s a street cafe in Vietnam, so don’t worry about the trash on the street.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2019",
